{"nodes": [{"id": "src_analysis_func_analysis_tab", "label": "Analysis Tab (local analysis of local and remote results)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/Analysis_Func.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A dedicated tab where every analysis runs locally; remote jobs are captured automatically and the local copy analyzed. Mostly a reorganization + gap-filling of existing viewers, not a greenfield build."}, {"id": "src_analysis_func_analysis_dir", "label": "_analysis_dir Remote-capture Mechanism", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/Analysis_Func.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The remote-capture problem is already solved: _analysis_dir(path, machine, heavy) returns the path for local machines, else rsyncs the job into REMOTE_RESULT_CACHE and pulls named heavy files on demand. Every analysis endpoint routes through it, so mixing machines in one analysis just works."}, {"id": "src_analysis_func_free_energy_diagram", "label": "Free-energy Diagram / CHE Overpotential", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/Analysis_Func.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The key screening tool: cumulative dG staircase at U=0 and U, potential-determining step, limiting potential U_L and overpotential vs an equilibrium potential (computational hydrogen electrode). A pure composition of adsorption_energy + thermo_from_job, no new physics parsing."}, {"id": "src_analysis_func_surface_energy", "label": "Surface Energy gamma(slab, bulk)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/Analysis_Func.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_analysis_func_qe_parity", "label": "QE Parity for Energies (read_job_energy dispatch)", "file_typ